        answer: "For close-up scanning (such as business cards or brochures), the minimum recommended size is 20 x 20 mm (0.8 x 0.8 inches). Never print a QR code smaller than 15 x 15 mm on commercial packaging, as smartphone cameras may struggle to focus on dense modules.",
